			<div class="content" id="post-content-4052948">
									

<p>Good notes. I’ll take the advice on this. Quite honestly, I’ve been meaning to rewrite this thing ever since I rushed it out to submit to the contest in time. I wrote like half of it in a matter of hours - and certain parts are definitely all the worse for it. Some time in the future, when I have a little less stuff on my plate, I will definitely be coming back to this piece.</p>
<p>Also I never actually said or implied that for some reason the sun would hit the tallest object last, as if it came from below or something. I just put an “even” in that second sentence to throw attention to the contrasting darkness within the room where the story starts.</p>

